      <activity id="a979a5b4-1d04-51bf-baf7-fc585f061683" activityNameId="da49b433-4907-5f9c-bac2-cb055f956e0a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Metal working factory operation, heat energy from heavy fuel oil</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Metal working factory operation, heat energy from heavy fuel oil
1 kg of this process is needed to produce 1 kg of final product. The data is an estimation based on the average consumption of factories separated into process specific (included in metal working machine operation) and ancillary processes (included here).;
UUID: c623c330-4f25-3508-9286-32a09a4f77f8
This dataset includes ancillary processes to operate a metal working factory. This encompasses  electricity for lighting and general water consumption. Heat energy is from heavy fuel oil.
Location: Average data from several local to global sized companies. The main focus is on Germany and Europe.
Technology: The companies are expected to cover the whole range of metal working.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c623c330-4f25-3508-9286-32a09a4f77f8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
